note Click a group's row in the Paths list to open or close it. A closed group hides every path and group inside it; the row shows the group's last name segment, the number of paths under it, and turns red when any of them has a stale step. Until clicked, a group is open exactly when the path being read is inside it. The choice lasts for the session.

